                'OFFERED TO READERS BINDERY SERVICES LIBRARY CHARGES OPENING HOURS LIBRARY OBJECTIVES Home Articles '
                'Events Honor Thesis About Search term Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to '
                'search: Map Profiles Main Content ELECTRONIC BOOKS ELECTRONIC BOOKS DATABASE NAME SUBJECT COVERAGE '
                'Bartley by The full text of many classic literary works, including Shakespeare. '
                'http://www.bartleyby.com/ BOOKBOON An online book publishing company that provides free textbooks to '
                'students all around the world. The topics covered by the textbooks range from economics to '
                'engineering and information technology, while the professional books cover personal development, '
                'marketing, human resource, management and many more professional topics. http://bookboon.com/ Booksee '
                'This is a portal that offers over 2,400,000 downloadable ebooks (PDFs). It has a keyword search '
                'engine plus a broad subject category listing in all the subjects. http://en.booksee.org/ Directory of '
                'Open Access Journals (DOAJ) An online directory that indexes and provides access to quality open '
                'access, peer-reviewed journals in all fields. Free Books for Doctors - www.freebooks4doctors.com/ An '
                'online site that provides free access to medical books. http://doaj.org/ E prints in Library and '
                'Information Science (E-LIS) An international open access repository for academic papers in, Library '
                'and Information Science and Information technology.it offers full text access to over 12,000 papers. '
                'http://eprints.rclis.org/ GOOGLE SCHOLAR Is a freely accessible web search engine that indexes the '
                'full text of scholarly literature across an array of publishing formats and disciplines. '
                'http://scholar.google.com/ Internet Public Library 45000 + full text works, fiction and non- fiction '
                'plus online reference works. Divided into subject collection. http://www.ipl.org/ Medical student A '
                'digital library of authoritative medical education information for the medical student and all '
                'students of medicine. www.medicalstudent.com Net Library free titles Over 3,000 out of copyright '
                'works, including the Bible, Shakespeare, and classic works of literature and philosophy. '
                'http://www.netlibrary.com/ Online Books An index of over 1million online freely readable books over '
                'the internet. It’s hosted by the university of Pennsylvania libraries. '
                'http://onlinebooks.library.upenn.edu Open Book Publishers Founded in 2008 by a small group of '
                'academics at the University of Cambridge. Offers access to pdf and eBook editions, but they also '
                'include a free online edition that can be read via the website or downloaded. '
                'http://www.openbookpublishers.com/ Oxford Text Archive The archive holds several thousand electronic '
                'texts and linguistics corpora, in a variety of languages. Includes online versions of works by '
                'individual authors, standard reference works and a range of language corpora. http://ota.ahds.ac.uk/ '
                'Pdf Drive Pdf Drive is a search engine for PDF ebook files. https://www.pdfdrive.com/ Project '
                'Gutenberg A fully searchable collection of 18000 + Multilanguage eBooks. Many classic titles and '
                'other formats such as audio books. It has a fully searchable online catalogue. '
                'http://www.gutenberg.org/ TEEAL: ( The Essential Electronic Agricultural Library). The library offers '
                'access to the essential electronic agricultural library (TEEAL) through the Cornell University’s Mann '
                'library which is a full text and searchable database of articles from more than 275 high quality '
                'research journals of agriculture and related sciences spanning several years. It is a searchable '
                'offline digital library updated annually. https://www.teeal.org/ World Bank open Knowledge repository '
                'The World Bank Open Knowledge Repository (OKR) is The World Bank’s official open access repository '
                'for its research outputs and knowledge products. https://openknowledge.worldbank.org/ mode_comment '
