                'News Kisii University Receives Best University Tax Club Award by H.E. President William Ruto, PhD '
                'Posted on Nov 20,2025 by kisii-university NEWS Kisii University was proudly recognized at Statehouse, '
                'Nairobi, as the recipient of the Best University Tax Club Award by H.E. President William Ruto, PhD. '
                'This prestigious honor celebrates our outstanding work in promoting tax education, enhancing '
                'compliance, and empowering vulnerable communities with knowledge and understanding. Under the '
                'visionary leadership and unwavering support of our Vice Chancellor, the University,s Tax Society has '
